        "information_NYnLpw": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "General",
            "title": "What is halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>Halfday is a new era iced tea. We've kept the classic iced tea taste you know and love, and recreated it with modern gut-healthy ingredients.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_9kE7mF": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "General",
            "title": "Where can I find Halfday in stores?",
            "infos": "<p>Halfday can be purchased directly from our website, but if you feel like heading outside (we recommend it) use our store locator to find a retailer near you. Still no luck? Send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:hey@drinkhalfday.com\" title=\"mailto:hey@drinkhalfday.com\">hey@drinkhalfday.com</a> and we'll help you out. </p>"
          }
        },
        "information_rEHN6d": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "General",
            "title": "Can I contact Halfday for support?",
            "infos": "<p>You sure can, and we'd love to help you out. Send us an email to <a href=\"mailto:hey@drinkhalfday.com\" title=\"mailto:hey@drinkhalfday.com\">hey@drinkhalfday.com</a> and someone from our team will be in touch. </p>"
          }
        },
        "information_HDAR7T": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "General",
            "title": "Is your packaging recylcable?",
            "infos": "<p>All of our packaging is 100% recyclable.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_YV3kdK": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "What are prebiotics?",
            "infos": "<p>Put simply, prebiotics are food for probiotics! And probiotics are live bacteria that naturally live in your body. (Notice the PRE- vs PRO- prefix. There's a difference!) Probiotics are 'good bacteria' that are important for a healthy gut, and in turn, overall health. So it's important to feed them what they like. And they LOVE prebiotics, like the fiber in Halfday.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_e78qDm": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Why is there prebiotic fiber in Halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>Great question! Halfday was started because of our cofounder Kayvon's journey with ulcerative colitis. You can learn about that on the Our Story section of our website. Also, did you know that on average, Americans get less than a third of their daily recommended intake of fiber. This nutrient is important to digestive health and we're on a mission to make it easier for you to consume fiber in fun and delicious ways, like iced tea!</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_HahGcR": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "What types of prebiotic fiber are in Halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>Halfday has created the GOODDAY Prebiotic Blend, which is a combination of 3 different, high-quality prebiotic sources. It consists of Cassava Root Fiber, Organic Agave Inulin, and Fructan Fiber. We believe that 3 fiber sources are better than one to help keep your gut feeling great.</p><p><strong>Organic Agave Inulin: </strong>A natural superfood that feeds the good bacteria in your gut, helping with digestion and overall wellness.</p><p><strong>Cassava Root Fiber:</strong> Fiber that keeps things moving and helps you feel full longer.</p><p><strong>Fructan Fiber: </strong>A prebiotic that supports gut balance and nutrient absorption.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_BXBdJP": {
          "type": "information",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Is there caffeine in Halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>-------</p>"
