        },
        "information_Qyq8r3": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "How is Halfday sweetened?",
            "infos": "<p>Halfday is sweetened by using a blend of fruit juices, organic raw cane sugar and a mild form of stevia. All of which combine to create the perfect classic iced tea taste. </p>"
          }
        },
        "information_gwAAaq": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "How much sugar is in Halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>We only use 3-5g of sugar in each can of Halfday, but they taste like the classic iced teas that you know and love. </p>"
          }
        },
        "information_W8ncbB": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Is Halfday Kosher?",
            "infos": "<p>Yes, Halfday is OU Kosher certified. Huzzah!</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_3fCtCq": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Can I drink while pregnant or breastfeeding?",
            "infos": "<p>It's always a good idea to check in with your healthcare provider before introducing something new to your diet while pregnant or breastfeeding.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_r7DxBh": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Can children consume Halfday?",
            "infos": "<p>The American Academy of Pediatrics reccomends that children under 12 avoid caffeine altogether, while those aged 12-18 should limit their intake to 100mg per day. Halfday has a small amount of caffeine in each bottle, that is naturally occuring in the tea leaves. Depending on the flavor, Halfday contains between 25-50mg of caffiene. You may find the exact amounts of caffeine under the question \"Is there caffeine in Halfday\" </p>"
          }
        },
        "information_m3zLyP": {
          "type": "information",
          "settings": {
            "faq_category": "Products",
            "title": "Does Halfday need to be refrigerated?",
            "infos": "<p>Nope! It's shelf stable but for best taste, we highly recommend you chill it before sipping....or chugging.</p>"
          }
        },
        "information_Baqrkb": {
          "type": "information",
