            "title": "Can you deliver to PO Boxes or AFO/FPO addresses?",
            "infos": "<p>There are limitations, which prevent us from shipping certain products to some geographical locations in the U.S. The locations include U.S. territories, protectorates, P.O. Boxes, military installations (APO/FPO addresses), and diplomatic posts (DPO addresses). </p>"
